# Playwright MCP scratch output.
# MUST stay ignored. These are verbatim accessibility dumps of whatever page the
# browser was on, including input field VALUES. On 2026-08-20 a session opened the
# Amplify environment-variables editor and the resulting snapshots captured the
# Supabase service-role key, PayPal secret, Resend key, Facebook token, Zoho secret,
# CRON_SECRET and the Turnstile secret in plaintext — which were then auto-committed.
# Caught before any push; nothing reached the remote. Do not un-ignore this.
.playwright-mcp/